  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Primary amines react with Para-toluene sulphonyl chloride to form a precipitate that is soluble in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math>.</p><p>Secondary amines reacts with Para-toluene sulphonyl chloride to give a precipitate that is insoluble in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math>.</p><p>Tertiary amines do not react with Para-toluene sulphonyl&nbsp;chloride.</p>",
